Simulation is under the martingale pricing measure $\mathbb{N}$. You need another measure for:
1. exposure under the real-world measure (assets evolve under $\mathbb{P}$, not under $\mathbb{N}$);
2. stress testing (risk factors conditional on a scenario);
3. right-way/wrong-way risk (conditioning on the counterparty default).
